  m_Name: Stomach.001
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ModelPartDataSO
  id: Stomach.001
  partName: Stomach
  descriptionChunks:
  - The stomach is a muscular organ that plays a central role in digestion by breaking
    down food using acids and enzymes. It mechanically churns food and mixes it with
    digestive juices to form a semi-liquid substance.
  - This process prepares food for further digestion and nutrient absorption in the
    intestines. The stomach also helps regulate the release of food into the small
    intestine. Its function is essential for efficient digestion and proper nutrient
    processing.
